{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aDiamond Treasure\u300b is a treasure exploration game brimming with a luxurious atmosphere and thrilling experiences. Players will feel their hearts race every time they open the mysterious diamond treasure chest. Here, there is no false ostentation; everything is presented in an open and transparent manner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Diamond Treasure Chest: The magnificent special effects at the moment of opening bring a dual shock to both the eyes and the mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047580/extras/5d94497152681dd99d039ed6199566ed.avif?t=1761301737\" width=1560 height=884 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Probability display: All acquisition methods are presented in dynamic text and fluctuating effects, ensuring fairness, clarity, and transparency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silver Chest: Common 90% Rare 8% Epic 2% </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Chest: Common 70% Rare 20% Epic 10% </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047580/extras/ffd47474fb62ace9dbd9ac50954f13b5.avif?t=1761301737\" width=1560 height=874 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Fair Trade Market: Players can exchange and bid on diamonds here. All rules are clear at a glance, ensuring complete fairness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047580/extras/eebed9e97354a772dac6b3f05d543cb4.avif?t=1761301737\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Special Supreme Event: Unique gameplay and exclusive diamond rewards available periodically, exclusively for players who dare t